{"id":"n50103-1-8","stage":2,"title":"리모컨 · 遥控器","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50103-1-8-1","ko":"티브이 켜게 리모컨 좀 줘.","zh":"把遥控器给我，我要开电视。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"티브이","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"티브이：电视，电视机。","readings":[{"term":"티브이","audio":"/audio/aeaf99c45109f1770ab5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71302","senseId":"1","lemma":"티브이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"티브이","audio":"/audio/aeaf99c45109f1770ab5.mp3"}},{"text":"켜게","meaning":"打开，发动","explanation":"켜다：打开，发动；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"켜다","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72168","senseId":"2","lemma":"켜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"켜게","audio":"/audio/51ed89307dcab2f9df42.mp3"}},{"text":"리모컨","meaning":"遥控器","explanation":"리모컨：遥控器。","readings":[{"term":"리모컨","audio":"/audio/4fdc1e3542b9f07eb815.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50103","senseId":"1","lemma":"리모컨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"리모컨","audio":"/audio/4fdc1e3542b9f07eb815.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줘","audio":"/audio/18f9b8e039d5f6a8cee6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aeaf99c45109f177","term":"티브이","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/aeaf99c45109f1770ab5.mp3","entryId":"71302","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c21cbaed08b52b5b","term":"켜다"